QuestGuidance.Register("en",453,{
[14465]="7006C6E1\n1\tLearn about the Shagâni culture from people around the Wrackwade ([see journal]/6)\tRaphûz wants to collect information on the ways and customs of Shagâna. He will ask around the Wrackwade camp and then you will both discuss what you learned.\n2\tReturn to Raphûz and share what you learned\tYou spoke to several members of the Wrackwade to learn about Shagâni culture. You should return to Raphûz to compare what you learned with one another.\n",
[14466]="7000F0BC\n1\tFind Juhani\tKissa-sari is an island in the river to the south and slightly east of Zigilgund. Tero suggests you search an island known as Kissa-sari for his friend Juhani.\n",
[14467]="700515FE\n1\tFind black cats for Iris Tunnelly in Wistmead (total: 4)\tBlack cats can be found throughout Wistmead. Iris Tunnelly has asked you to aid her in gathering a number of black cats in Wistmead that they might bring joy to festival-goers and eventually find a new home in Bree-town.\n2\tTalk to Iris Tunnelly in Wistmead\tIris Tunnelly can be found in Wistmead. You have found several black cats for Iris Tunnelly, and you should now bring them to her in Wistmead.\n",
[14468]="70054883\n1\tYou are fated to labour in service to the Dark Lord.\t\n2\tCollect a bucket from the Foul Larder\tA bucket can be found in the Foul Larder in the dungeons of Barad-dûr.\n3\tFill the bucket with water from the washing-tub\tA washing-tub can be found in the Foul Larder in the dungeons of Barad-dûr.\n4\tExhausted Stout-axes can be found throughout the dungeons of Barad-dûr.\t\n",
[14469]="7005465C\n1\tDestroy barricades (total: 8)\tBarricades inside the city will jeopardize the Rangers' attempts to infiltrate Minas Morgul, and should be destroyed. Report to Dolenthol when the work is done.\n2\tTalk to Dolenthol\tLocate Dolenthol and inform him that you destroyed several barricades in the area.\n",
[14470]="70022B01\n1\tDefeat grim Ashenwight ritualists (total: 3)\tTrac-Plas lies to the south and west of Mincham's camp. Mincham asked you to defeat the wights performing the foul rituals at Trac-Plas.\n2\tTalk to Mincham in the Lich Bluffs\tMincham's camp is located south and slightly west of the large Gondorian ruins in the Lich Bluffs. You should return to Mincham and let him know that you have defeated the ritualists and disrupted their ritual.\n",
[14471]="7004E92E\n1\tWeaken Orkish scaffolding\tWeaken Orkish scaffolding.\n2\tWeaken Orkish scaffolding (total: 10)\tYou should weaken Orkish scaffolding in Glimmerdeep mine.\n3\tCompleted\tWeakened Orkish scaffolding.\n",
[14472]="70035200\n1\tBurn White Hand banners\tWhite Hand Banners can be found at Fushaum-dorám in the south-eastern Writhendowns. You should destroy the banners of the Orcs to weaken their pleasure in their victory at Scylfig.\n2\tBurn White Hand banners (total: 8)\tWhite Hand Banners can be found at Fushaum-dorám in the south-eastern Writhendowns. You should destroy the banners of the Orcs to weaken their pleasure in their victory at Scylfig.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have burned the banners at Fushaum-dorám, lessening the Orcs' pleasure in their victory over Scylfig.\n",
[14473]="7003A622\n1\tDestroy Boar-totems\tThere are several Boar-totems placed throughout the cave. Destroying them may lower the morale of the Boar-tribe.\n2\tDestroy Boar-totems (total: 3)\tThere are several Boar-totems placed throughout the cave. Destroying them may lower the morale of the Boar-tribe.\n3\tCompleted\tDestroying the Boar-totems has lowered the morale of the Boar-tribe Orcs.\n",
[14474]="700082D2\n1\tDefeat Ongbúrz Bone-speaker (total: 10)\tOngbúrz Bone-speakers can be found in the deepest reaches of Dol Dínen, beyond the siege-engines, south-east of Esteldín. These sorcerers among the Orcs of Dol Dínen must be defeated.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated a number of Ongbúrz Bone-speakers in Dol Dínen.\n",
[14475]="7006C6F9\n1\tMake your way to the last pillars leading into Nirgambâr\tRaphûz requested you meet him in the deepest part of Nirgambâr to seek wealth from the Dead that make the tombs their home.\n2\tComplete Instance: Wealth of the Dead\tYou found Raphûz in the ruins of Nirgambâr. He is prepared to find wealth among the Dead here. Work with him and find the wealth he desires.\n3\tSpeak with Raphûz at his home in Jirush\tRaphûz claimed to have acquired enough wealth from the Dead to meet Igbâl's request. He asked you to meet him back at his home in Jirush to discuss further.\n",
[14476]="7004E4F2\n1\tRecover stolen weapons (total: 7)\tThe dwarf-made weapons stolen by the Jangovar may still be nearby! You should recover stolen weapons.\n2\tTalk to Grámi Hornhelm\tYou should talk to Grámi Hornhelm, who can be found inside Hammerstead, in the northern Ironfold.\n",
[14477]="70040385\n1\tDestroy weapon-stashes\tWeapon-stashes can be found in Tathrendalf in north-eastern Lamedon. You should destroy Corsair weapon-stashes.\n2\tDestroy weapon-stashes (total: 8)\tWeapon-stashes can be found in Tathrendalf in north-eastern Lamedon. You should destroy Corsair weapon-stashes.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have destroyed a number of weapon-stashes in Tathrendalf, the Corsair encampment.\n",
[14478]="70069444\n1\tCraft a crate of weapons for the Umbar Weaponsmith's Guild\tThe recipe needed to complete this quest is available for purchase. Purchase the quest recipe from the guild leader. Package a crate of weapons for Umbar Baharbêl.\n2\tDeliver a crate of weapons to the Umbar Weaponsmith's Guild Leader\tBring the crate of weapons to the Umbar Weaponsmith's Guild Leader.\n",
[14479]="7006B107\n1\tCraft a crate of weapons for the Umbar Weaponsmith's Guild\tThe recipe needed to complete this quest is available for purchase. Purchase the quest recipe from the guild leader. Package a crate of weapons for Umbar Baharbêl.\n2\tDeliver a crate of weapons to the Umbar Weaponsmith's Guild Leader\tBring the crate of weapons to the Umbar Weaponsmith's Guild Leader.\n",
[14480]="70072EFD\n1\tExamine the empty weapon rack in Drushkála\tAn empty weapon rack stands within Drushkála.\n2\tFind another weapon rack to the east in Drushkála\tYou might learn more about the Grishúlvosh if you find more weapon racks to the east in Drushkála.\n3\tAnother weapon rack stands to the south-east in Drushkála. Does this one still bear weapons?\t\n4\tCompleted\tMany of the weapons in Drushkála have been brought to the ship Grishúlvosh.\n",
[14481]="7006715E\n1\tCollect forgotten weapons throughout Furukzahar (total: 10)\tForgotten weapons have been discarded throughout Furukzahar and should be returned to the Armoury.\n2\tBring the forgotten weapons to Shegai in the Armoury\tShegai is in the Armoury of Furukzahar.\n",
[14482]="7006944D\n1\tComplete Umbar Weaponsmith's Guild daily orders (total: 5)\tComplete requests from the Umbar Weaponsmith's Guild. You can acquire these quests from the Umbar Weaponsmith's Guild Leader in the Umbar Baharbêl craft guild hall.\n2\tCompleted\tYou completed many Umbar weaponsmith requests.\n",
[14483]="7004A823\n1\tDestroy spear racks (total: 6)\030Destroy bow racks (total: 6)\030Destroy sword racks (total: 6)\tIngold has asked you to destroy weapon racks at Fushaum Tûm.\n",
[14484]="7004135B\n1\tCollect weapons (total: 6)\tCorsair weapons can be found in the village of Tungobel. Steal weapons from Corsair forces.\n2\tTalk to Erchar at his encampment\tErchar can be found at his encampment in the western end of Dor-en-Ernil, south-west of Tungobel. Return the weapons to Erchar.\n3\tPut the weapons in the barrel\tThe weapons barrel can be found at Erchar's encampment in the western end of Dor-en-Ernil. Put the weapons in the barrel.\n4\tTalk to Erchar at his encampment\tErchar can be found at his encampment in the western end of Dor-en-Ernil. Return the weapons to Erchar.\n",
[14485]="70008854\n1\tReturn to Chieftain Torbok at the Grimwood Lumber-yard\030Collect Grimwood-logs (total: 5)\030Collect Isendeep-ore (total: 5)\tWood can be found in the Grimwood Forest, and metal can be found in the Isendeep Mine. Chieftain Torbok directed you to support the war effort by stripping the mines and forest bare.\n",
[14486]="7000E3DA\n1\tDefeat Goeolgon\tHandarod is at Esteldín in the North Downs. Handarod has bid you enter Barad Dúrgul and recover the ring Narchuil.\n2\tReport to Gwathryn\tGwathryn is at Tármunn Súrsa in Angmar. You should report to Gwathryn at once.\n",
[14487]="7005AAA8\n1\tDestroy hobgoblin weapons in Shakhajât (total: 10)\tHobgoblin weapons can be found throughout Shakhajât, and should be destroyed.\n2\tTalk to Klúso\tKlúso is waiting for your report.\n",
[14488]="7003FFBA\n1\tRecover weapons (total: 5)\tThe weapons must be recovered.\n",
[14489]="70072BFB\n1\tExamine the pods of the blight in Adagím\tPods of the blight draw your attention in the woods of Adagím.\n2\tCollect teeth from crocodiles in Adagím (total: 3)\030Collect venom sacs from spiders in Adagím (total: 3)\tCrocodile teeth and venom sacs make the predators within Adagím extremely deadly.\n3\tLeave the teeth and venom sacs in a strongbox at Laivárth\tThe nearest grove of the Kintai is named Laivárth. The Elves there will have a strongbox in which you can deposit the crocodile teeth and venom sacs you recovered.\n4\tCompleted\tYou have deprived the crocodiles and spiders of Adagím of their deadly weapons.\n",
[14490]="70001204\n1\tFind a torch to burn the siege-tower\tThe caves of Grishbalt lie north of Gabilshathûr, along the east side of Duvuinen. Avar asked you to find and destroy the two siege-weapons the Orcs have hidden there.\n2\tFind a torch to burn the catapult\tThe caves of Grishbalt lie north of Gabilshathûr, along the east side of Duvuinen. Avar asked you to find and destroy the two siege-weapons the Orcs have hidden there.\n3\tTalk to Avar\tAvar is at Gabilshathûr, south of Duvuinen. You should return to the Avar with word of your success.\n",
[14491]="70048C78\n1\tCollect spear-heads (total: 6)\030Collected spear-shafts (total: 6)\tSpear-heads and spear-shafts have been hidden all over Bhol Rûdh. You should collect spear-heads and spear-shafts.\n2\tAssemble spears (total: 2)\tSpear-racks can be found in Bhol Rûdh, next to Dhôm-dhuga-Nôkh. You should assemble spears and place them on the spear-racks.\n3\tTalk to Dhôm-dhuga-Nôkh\tDhôm-dhuga-Nôkh can be found in Bhol Rûdh. You should talk to Dhôm-dhuga-Nôkh.\n",
[14492]="70047A84\n1\tGather Orc weapons (total: 8)\tOrcs can be found within the caverns of Skoironk. You should defeat Orcs and gather their weapons.\n2\tBring the weapons to Thurindol\tThurindol can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills. You should speak with Thurindol.\n",
[14493]="700359A9\n1\tForge an expert ice-pick for the workers of Wildermore (quantity: see journal)\tHildelith has given you a recipe for an expert ice-pick. You should forge an expert ice pick for the workers trying to break the ice left by Núrzum.\n2\tDeliver the expert ice-pick to Hildelith\tHildelith is in Forlaw. You have forged an expert ice-pick and should now deliver it to Forlaw.\n",
[14494]="7004E4F9\n1\tTalk to Belg Thickshanks\tGrámi Hornhelm has requested that you help craft a weapon. You should talk to Belg Thickshanks to proceed.\n2\tHeat steel in the forge\tBelg Thickshanks has asked you to help craft a dagger in Hammerstead. You should use the forge to heat steel.\n3\tTalk to Belg Thickshanks\tBelg Thickshanks has asked you to help craft a dagger in Hammerstead. You should talk to Belg Thickshanks.\n4\tHammer the steel on the anvil\tBelg Thickshanks has asked you to help craft a dagger in Hammerstead. You should hammer the steel on the anvil to shape it.\n5\tTalk to Belg Thickshanks\tBelg Thickshanks has asked you to help craft a dagger in Hammerstead. You should talk to Belg Thickshanks.\n6\tHone the blade on the grindstone\tBelg Thickshanks has asked you to help craft a dagger in Hammerstead. You should hone the edge of the blade on the grindstone.\n7\tTalk to Belg Thickshanks\tBelg Thickshanks has asked you to help craft a dagger in Hammerstead. You should talk to Belg Thickshanks.\n8\tRe-heat the blade in the forge\tBelg Thickshanks has asked you to help craft a dagger in Hammerstead. You should re-heat the blade in the forge.\n9\tQuench the blade in the water tank\tBelg Thickshanks has asked you to help craft a dagger in Hammerstead. You should quench the red-hot blade in the water tank.\n10\tTalk to Belg Thickshanks\tBelg Thickshanks has asked you to help craft a dagger in Hammerstead. You should talk to Belg Thickshanks.\n11\tAssemble the dagger at the assembly table\tBelg Thickshanks has asked you to help craft a dagger in Hammerstead. You should assemble the dagger at the assembly table.\n12\tTalk to Belg Thickshanks\tBelg Thickshanks has asked you to help craft a dagger in Hammerstead. You should talk to Belg Thickshanks.\n13\tTalk to Grámi Hornhelm\tYou should talk to Grámi Hornhelm, who can be found in Hammerstead.\n",
[14495]="7000004A\n1\tBring spider-eyes to Hunulf Munce\030Collect Crimson Moor-web Eye (total: 4)\030Collect Inky Moor-web Eye (total: 4)\tSpiders can be found in the valley beneath Minas Eriol, north-west of the Eglain over-look. Hunulf Munce believes that you can take the eyes from the Moor-web spiders beneath Minas Eriol, depriving them of their strength.\n",
[14496]="70000DC8\n1\tGet past the webs in Lob's Grove\tThe spider-nest is to the north-west of Overhill town centre, past the wall and the lumber-yard. Shirriff Smallburrow sent you to Gammer Boffin in Overhill to obtain something to dissolve the spider-webs blocking the way to the nest. Gammer warned you that the mixture dries quickly, so you must hurry. She also mentioned a nursery story about a walking tree in Bindbole Wood that might serve as an ally... if it even exists.\n2\tFind the walking tree\tThe walking tree, if it exists, probably can be found somewhere in the spider nest. You were able to clear the way to the nest using Gammer Boffin's draught. She also mentioned a nursery story about a walking tree in the wood that might help to deal with the spiders, though she warned it might be dangerous to you as well.\n",
})
